1334..1408 Comment "/// A forged section: the loop arm answers with the rest\'s path unchanged,"
1409..1487 Comment "/// typed at the motive at `q`, where the arm owes the motive at `loop ∷ q`:"
1488..1567 Comment "/// a path from `loop ∷ spin(wind(q))` to `loop ∷ q`. The two path types do"
1568..1608 Comment "/// not convert, and the arm is refused."
